Functional:
1. It reads the file in specified directory. Below paramters can control behavior of file read.
  IN_FILE_PATH::Path to read sub-directories and files.
  IN_SEARCH_MAX_DEPTH::Maximum level of sub-directories depth to read
  IN_FILE_PATTERN::File patterns to read
  IN_FAIL_IF_FILE_NOT_FOUND::Flag to check whether graph will fail if file not found or not defaut is "Y"
  IN_FILES_COMPRESSED::Read compressed files. Default is "N"
  IN_FILTER_START_DATE::Filter files having date in file name greater than this date
  IN_FILTER_END_DATE::Filter files having date in file name lesser than this date
  IN_OUTPUT_FILE_NAME_WITH_PATH_ONLY::If True output will have fileNameWithPath no data will flow out.

